{"unit_id":"christophersmith2737-commits__OffPeak#card-zh","repo":"christophersmith2737-commits/OffPeak","commit":"a3d676f3b8643b8d7b869a3c7a7a517556d6ea55","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"OffPeak 是面向 DSH web profile 的 DeepSeek 峰谷定价提醒插件。它在北京时间高峰窗口检测发送动作，并在浏览器 composer 中拦截提交，展示模型价格与消息内容；用户可以继续正常发送、关闭提醒，或选择闲时安排稍后执行。计划任务保存在 profile 的 offpeak.json 中，到时由服务端提交到原会话，也可查看、取消或立即执行任务。适合希望避开 DeepSeek 高峰价格、安排提示词稍后运行的 DSH Web 用户。无需 API 密钥；需要安装到 web profile。","source":"generated","evidence":["client/client.js:17-23","src/index.js:225-255","src/index.js:257-328","src/index.js:330-337","cordis.patch.yml:18-25"]}
{"unit_id":"christophersmith2737-commits__OffPeak#card-en","repo":"christophersmith2737-commits/OffPeak","commit":"a3d676f3b8643b8d7b869a3c7a7a517556d6ea55","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"OffPeak is a DSH web plugin for DeepSeek users. During Beijing peak hours it shows model prices before a prompt is sent. Users can send now or schedule the prompt for an off-peak time; the server saves it and submits it to the original session when due. Requires the DSH web profile; no API key.","source":"generated","evidence":["client/client.js:17-23","src/index.js:225-255","src/index.js:257-328","src/index.js:330-337","cordis.patch.yml:18-25"]}
