{"unit_id":"christophersmith2737-commits__OffPeak#feature-1","repo":"christophersmith2737-commits/OffPeak","commit":"a3d676f3b8643b8d7b869a3c7a7a517556d6ea55","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"OffPeak 的功能「高峰发送提醒」：在 DeepSeek 高峰窗口提交消息时显示提醒和当前模型价格。用户可以选择继续发送、关闭窗口，或标记当天不再提醒。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:225-255","client/client.js:426-450"]}
